@startuml agentic-system-agent-boundary
title Agentic System / Agent Boundary ; per ADR-ES-025 section 5

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic System" as ASys
class "Agent" as Ag

ASys --> Ag : engages

note right
  Per ADR-ES-025 section 5:
  Agent performs or coordinates actions.
  Agentic System is the system whose material
  behavior incorporates agentic operation.
  A System may engage an Agent without
  automatically being an Agentic System.
  An Agentic System need not be defined as an Agent.
end note

@enduml
